e en nieuwere knipwerken waarin kleine ingrepen grote beelden maken. Het museum laat de verbeeldingskracht en precisie van papierknipkunst zien.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["papierkunst","volkskunst"],"photos":[],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"ca6ae9b5-43dc-5ebe-9c2a-e91623187ac5","inventory_key":"art-audit:206","name":"De Kopermolen","city":"Vaals","province":"Limburg","street_address":"Von Clermontplein 11","postal_code":"6291 AT","country":"NL","website_url":"https://dekopermolenvaals.nl/nl/","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Ontdek wisselende kunst in De Kopermolen. Schilderijen, sculpturen, fotografie en andere disciplines krijgen er een podium, met aandacht voor makers uit de regio. Het programma biedt steeds een nieuwe reden om binnen te lopen.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["hedendaagse kunst","kunsthal","beeldhouwkunst"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Vaals-Evangelisch_Lutherse_kerk_%281%29.JPG/1280px-Vaals-Evangelisch_Lutherse_kerk_%281%29.JPG","caption":"De Kopermolen — Vaals-Evangelisch Lutherse kerk (1)","credit":"Romaine","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vaals-Evangelisch_Lutherse_kerk_(1).JPG","license":"CC0"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"7b8f4db6-e522-5daf-9561-97924ceafc87","inventory_key":"wikipedia:Limburg:odapark:venray","name":"Odapark","city":"Venray","province":"Limburg","street_address":"Merseloseweg 117","postal_code":"5801 CC","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.odapark.nl/","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Wandel tussen hedendaagse kunst en natuur. In Odapark veranderen beelden je blik op het landschap. Tentoonstellingen binnen en kunstwerken buiten vullen elkaar aan en nodigen uit om met aandacht rond te dwalen.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["hedendaagse kunst","beeldentuin","land art"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Odapark_Venray_%2816944985101%29.jpg/1280px-Odapark_Venray_%2816944985101%29.jpg","caption":"Odapark — Odapark Venray (16944985101)","credit":"FaceMePLS from The Hague, The Netherlands","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Odapark_Venray_(16944985101).jpg","license":"CC BY 2.0"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"f409e9dd-0646-565c-8b98-3a23c0ce884f","inventory_key":"art-audit:208","name":"Garage Rotterdam","city":"Rotterdam","province":"Zuid-Holland","street_address":"Goudsewagenstraat 27","postal_code":"3011 RH","country":"NL","website_url":"https://garagerotterdam.nl/","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Ontdek hoe kunstenaars actuele ideeën verbeelden in een voormalige garage. Garage Rotterdam presenteert thematische tentoonstellingen met uiteenlopende media. Performances en gesprekken geven de kunst extra context.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["hedendaagse kunst","kunsthal","installaties"],"photos":[],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"0c62923a-5d07-5f0a-8033-3f2cc8d25550","inventory_key":"art-audit:209","name":"Huize Frankendael","city":"Amsterdam","province":"Noord-Holland","street_address":"Middenweg 72","postal_code":"1097 BS","country":"NL","website_url":"https://huizefrankendael.nl/","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Ontdek hedendaagse kunst in de historische kamers van Huize Frankendael. Wisselende presentaties reageren op ruimte, omgeving en nieuwe ideeën. Het landhuis biedt een rustige setting waarin kunst en architectuur elkaar ontmoeten.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["hedendaagse kunst","kunsthal"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Frankendael_%28Amsterdam%29.JPG/1280px-Frankendael_%28Amsterdam%29.JPG","caption":"Huize Frankendael — Frankendael (Amsterdam)","credit":"P.H. Louw","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Frankendael_(Amsterdam).JPG","license":"CC BY 2.5 nl"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"cbf5bc39-7389-5448-9c62-be465d7360b8","inventory_key":"wikipedia:Flevoland:museumnagele:nagele","name":"Museum Nagele","city":"Nagele","province":"Flevoland","street_address":"Ring 23","postal_code":"8308 AL","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.museumnagele.nl/","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Ontdek Nagele als gebouwd experiment. Het museum laat zien hoe architecten als Rietveld en Van Eyck over wonen en samenleven nadachten. Wisselende tentoonstellingen verbinden die ontwerpgeschiedenis met beeldende kunst.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["architectuur","design","moderne kunst"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Nagele_museum.JPG/1280px-Nagele_museum.JPG","caption":"Museum Nagele — Nagele museum","credit":"Mark Ahsmann","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nagele_museum.JPG","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"c344234a-541f-52c4-8637-6425e7ceb449","inventory_key":"museum-nl:gorcums-museum","name":"Gorcums Museum","city":"Gorinchem","province":"Zuid-Holland","street_address":"Grote Markt 17","postal_code":"4201 EB","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.gorcumsmuseum.nl/","latitude":51.829598,"longitude":4.9744,"summary":"Ontdek kunst met Gorinchem als vertrekpunt. Het Gorcums Museum verbindt de stadsgeschiedenis met moderne en hedendaagse werken. Wisselende tentoonstellingen laten zien hoe kunstenaars steeds nieuwe perspectieven op hun omgeving openen.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["moderne kunst","hedendaagse kunst","schilderkunst"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Gorcums_Museum_P1050232.JPG/1280px-Gorcums_Museum_P1050232.JPG","caption":"Gorcums Museum — Gorcums Museum P1050232","credit":"G.Lanting","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gorcums_Museum_P1050232.JPG","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"6da8a831-f5cd-5269-a6ac-4a20b3c72482","inventory_key":"wikipedia:Noord-Holland:museumhilversum:hilversum","name":"Museum Hilversum","city":"Hilversum","province":"Noord-Holland","street_address":"Kerkbrink 6","postal_code":"1211 BX","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.museumhilversum.nl/","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"summary":"Laat foto''s je meenemen naar andere levens en werelden. Museum Hilversum richt zich op fotografie en onderzoekt ook de grenzen met andere kunstvormen. Wisselende tentoonstellingen maken iedere terugkeer een nieuwe kijkervaring.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["fotografie","beeldcultuur"],"photos":[{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/Museum_Hilversum.jpg","caption":"Museum Hilversum — Museum Hilversum","credit":"FaceMePLS","source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Museum_Hilversum.jpg","license":"CC BY 2.0"}],"is_art_museum":true},{"id":"72f70d1b-ef0f-512f-b0b4-348a50d90aa7","inventory_key":"museum-nl:purmerends-museum","name":"Purmerends Museum","city":"Purmerend","province":"Noord-Holland","street_address":"Kaasmarkt 20","postal_code":"1441 BG","country":"NL","website_url":"https://www.purmerendsmuseum.nl/","latitude":52.509977,"longitude":4.946311,"summary":"Ontdek het kleurige Jugendstil-aardewerk van Purmerend. De collectie laat zien hoe ontwerpers gebruiksvoorwerpen een uitgesproken karakter gaven. Architectuur en grafisch werk voegen andere kanten van de plaatselijke ontwerpgeschiedenis toe.","operating_status":"open","publication_status":"draft","verification_status":"unreviewed","tags":["keramiek","art nouveau","architectuur"],"photos":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5